---
import boywithpicklebot from "../../../assets/newdesignimages/boywithpicklebot.png";
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'
---

<div class="bg-[#191A16] py-16 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-white text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight upparcase">
            What Is a Pickleball Ball  
         <br/>
          Collector <span class="text-lime-400">AND WHY <br/>
          IT Matters</span>
        </h2>
        
       
        
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
         Manual ball pickup wastes<span class="text-lime-400 font-semibold"> 20-30% of on-court time.</span>  Every few minutes, play stops as players collect scattered balls, disrupting rhythm and reducing valuable practice time.
        </p>
         <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          A <span class="text-lime-400 font-semibold">pickleball machine</span> eliminates this downtime entirely. Instead of stopping drills to gather balls, an automated system continuously collects them while you play, maintaining training flow and maximizing court productivity.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        The Tennibot Rover redefines ball retrieval with <span class="text-lime-400 font-semibold">AI-enhanced tracking and movement.</span> Unlike simple remote-control devices, it intelligently navigates courts, recognizes pickleballs, and adapts to different playing scenarios automatically.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="lg:pl-8">
         <img     
          src={boywithpicklebot.src}
          alt="Tennibot Mobile App Interface"     
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="max-w-full h-auto"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>